WEBVTT

NOTE Captions timed proportionally by sentence; full transcript follows in lesson.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.661
Now look at the AI-assisted draft.

00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:04.436
The report sounds confident.

00:00:04.436 --> 00:00:11.533
It says ninety-five percent of requests were resolved on time, and it claims that performance improved.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:13.751
But those are new conclusions.

00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:17.743
They do not appear in our fictional source notes.

00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:22.622
Do not confuse a smooth explanation with a verified business fact.
